[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0610","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1550","title":"Keras Model.load_model 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Keras Model.load_model 函数存在任意代码执行漏洞，即使启用 safe_mode=True 也无法阻止。攻击者可构造恶意 .keras 归档文件，通过篡改其中的 config.json 指定任意 Python 模块和函数及其参数，在模型加载时被执行。该漏洞影响 Keras 3.9.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.3（HIGH），属于代码注入类漏洞（CWE-94）。攻击需要受害者加载恶意模型文件，利用方式为诱导用户加载经过篡改的模型存档，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1550"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-11T09:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:21Z","remediation":"升级 TensorFlow/Keras 到最新安全版本（≥2.15.0）并应用 GitHub 拉取请求 #20751 的补丁。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 Python 的 `pickle` 模块加载功能，并限制 `.keras` 归档文件的使用权限。通过 Keras 的 `load_model` 函数设置 `safe_mode=True` 并验证模型文件完整性。当前版本 Keras 2.15.0 已经修复了利用 config.json 进行代码执行的漏洞，建议立即应用安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/keras-team/keras/pull/20751","https://towerofhanoi.it/writeups/cve-2025-1550/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52359","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1550.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-15503.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1550.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5eee2445284809f10c9bff1b33b94a17c67c3758/2025/CVE-2025-1550.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/code/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1550.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1550.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1550.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/476692847f5c923330d7779e25a15364daedc6f8/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-1550.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ac00e78184328e367943bf1ac62d90181bdb5500/2025/CVE-2025-1550.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/476692847f5c923330d7779e25a15364daedc6f8/data/2025/CVE-2025-1550-ChCh0i_cve-2025-1550.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-15501.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-15500.md","https://github.com/ChCh0i/cve-2025-1550"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0832","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0832.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2137","title":"Google Chrome V8 越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在越界读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎中的越界内存访问，导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受到严重影响。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 134.0.6998.88 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级至 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2137"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-10T21:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:24Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 134.0.6998.88 或更高版本。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）应更新至对应最新版本。无法立即升级时，可禁用 V8 JIT（通过启动参数 `--js-flags=--jitless`）作为临时缓解措施，但会显著影响性能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/398999390","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-2137.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21371.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2025/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-2137.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-2137.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0832.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0821","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0821.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2136","title":"Google Chrome Inspector 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器 Inspector 组件存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞，CWE-416。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面并诱使目标用户访问，触发已释放内存的非法访问，导致堆破坏，最终实现远程代码执行或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，需用户交互方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2136"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-10T21:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:24Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 134.0.6998.88 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 检查更新并自动安装。企业用户可通过 Google Update 策略或 MSI 安装包批量推送更新。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）需同步更新至对应修复版本。该漏洞在 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 中已修复，无临时缓解措施，必须升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/395032416","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-2136.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21365.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2025/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-2136.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-2136.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0821.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0811","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0811.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2135","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 引擎存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞，CWE-843。攻击者可构造特制 HTML 页面，诱导用户访问后触发 V8 引擎对 JavaScript 对象类型的错误处理，导致堆内存破坏（heap corruption），进而实现任意地址读写，最终可能导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。攻击需用户交互（点击恶意链接或访问恶意网页），无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低。Google 已在 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2135"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-10T21:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 134.0.6998.88 或更高版本（通过 chrome://settings/help 检查更新并重启浏览器）。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（Microsoft Edge、Brave、Opera 等）需同步更新至对应修复版本。Linux 发行版用户请安装对应的 chromium 安全更新（如 Debian 的 DSA-5877）。如无法立即更新，可配置内容安全策略（CSP）限制 JavaScript 执行来源，并避免在未受保护的浏览器中访问不可信链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/400052777","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-2135.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2025/CVE-2025-2135.json","https://github.com/Petitoto/chromium-exploit-dev/blob/73186ef6546fc1eeff094ae33e6703c3cf83a528/vulns/memcor/CVE-2025-2135.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2135.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2135.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-2135.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2025/CVE-2025-2135.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/2025/CVE-2025-2135-Wa1nut4_CVE-2025-2135.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/2025/CVE-2025-2135-sangnguyenthien_CVE-2025-2135.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2025/CVE-2025-21357.md","https://github.com/Wa1nut4/CVE-2025-2135"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0811.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0629","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1920","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），攻击者可构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎在处理对象类型时发生混淆，导致堆内存损坏，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 134.0.6998.88 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1920"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-10T21:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 134.0.6998.88 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级。Debian 12 用户请执行 `apt update && apt upgrade chromium` 安装 DSA-5877-1 安全更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在浏览器中启用严格站点隔离（chrome://flags/#enable-site-isolation）并禁用 V8 JIT 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/398065918","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1920.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1920.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1920.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1920.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0033","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-24813","title":"Apache Tomcat 默认Servlet路径等价远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 默认 Servlet 存在路径等价漏洞（内部点号），当启用写入权限且支持部分 PUT 请求时，未授权攻击者可通过特制的部分 PUT 请求利用路径等价绕过安全检查，导致安全敏感文件泄露或向文件中注入恶意内容。若应用同时使用基于文件的会话持久化且存在反序列化利用库，攻击者可进一步实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 11.0.0-M1 至 11.0.2、10.1.0-M1 至 10.1.34、9.0.0.M1 至 9.0.98 及 8.5.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至 11.0.3、10.1.35 或 9.0.99 版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-24813"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-10T17:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:59:39Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 11.0.3 / 10.1.35 / 9.0.99 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，确保 Default Servlet 的 writable 配置为 false（默认关闭），禁用 partial PUT（设置 allowPartialPut=\"false\"），并避免使用文件会话持久化存储到默认路径，同时移除应用中可能被反序列化利用的类库（如 commons-collections 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread/j5fkjv2k477os90nczf2v9l61fb0kkgq","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/10/5","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/04/msg00003.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250321-0001/","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-detect-apache-tomcat-rce","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-mitigate-apache-tomcat-rce","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-tomcat-detect-vulnerability","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-24813-tomcat-mitigation-vulnerability","https://github.com/absholi7ly/POC-CVE-2025-24813/blob/main/README.md","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-24813","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52134","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-24813.yaml","https://github.com/Makavellik/POC-CVE-2025-24813-Apache-Tomcat-Remote-Code-Execution","https://github.com/absholi7ly/POC-CVE-2025-24813","https://github.com/iSee857/CVE-2025-24813-PoC","https://github.com/drcrypterdotru/Apache-GOExploiter","https://github.com/mbanyamer/Apache-Tomcat---Remote-Code-Execution-via-Session-Deserialization-CVE-2025-24813-","https://github.com/charis3306/CVE-2025-24813","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-24813"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0883","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0883.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-2153","title":"HDF5 H5文件处理器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HDF5 1.14.6 版本的 h5 文件处理器组件中的 H5SM.c 文件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可向目标系统发送特制 h5 文件，通过操控 H5SM_delete 函数触发堆溢出，实现远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 HDF5 库的广泛部署场景，攻击无需身份认证但复杂度较高且需要用户交互打开恶意文件。利用方法已公开披露，建议用户升级至安全版本并避免打开不可信来源的 h5 文件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-2153"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-10T14:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:06:25Z","remediation":"升级HDF5到包含安全修复的版本（HDF5 2.0.0或更高版本），该版本包含CVE-2025-2153修复。具体修复措施是：确保H5O__msg_write_real()函数中对消息共享标志的验证，这可以防止非共享消息被篡改为共享消息。如果无法立即更新，可在生产环境中通过代码审计方式查找所有H5SM_delete调用位置，并验证其输入验证逻辑，临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/HDFGroup/hdf5/issues/5329","https://github.com/sae-as-me/Crashes/raw/refs/heads/main/hdf5/h5_extended_crash.h5","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.299064","https://vuldb.com/?id.299064","https://vuldb.com/?submit.510819","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-2153.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2153.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2025/2xxx/CVE-2025-2153.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21534.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21536.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-2153.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-2153.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-2153.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-2153.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-2153.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0883.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0632","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0632.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1923","title":"Google Chrome 权限提示不当实现漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 134.0.6998.35 之前版本中的权限提示功能存在不当实现漏洞（CWE-1021）。攻击者通过诱使用户安装恶意 Chrome 扩展程序，可利用该扩展对浏览器权限对话框进行 UI 欺骗，使用户在不知情的情况下授予敏感权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限，但需要用户交互配合。影响范围包括 Google Chrome 及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 等浏览器。Chrome 团队已在 134.0.6998.35 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1923"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:21Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 134.0.6998.35 及以上版本，或升级 Microsoft Edge (Chromium 内核) 至 134.0.3124.51 及以上版本。可通过浏览器内置「关于」页面检查更新并自动安装。如无法立即升级，可在 Chrome 扩展管理页面审查并禁用非必要扩展，同时启用「增强安全保护」模式以降低恶意扩展利用权限提示界面欺骗的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/382540635","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1923.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-19xx/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1923.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1923.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2025/CVE-2025-1923.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0632.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0631","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0631.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1922","title":"Google Chrome Android Selection 组件界面欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome Android 版 Selection 组件存在 UI 欺骗漏洞（CWE-451），由于对用户界面交互实现不当，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面并诱导用户执行特定的 UI 手势操作，成功利用该漏洞可在目标设备上实现界面欺骗（UI Spoofing），误导用户与恶意界面交互。该漏洞影响 Android 平台 Google Chrome 134.0.6998.35 之前版本及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 134.0.3124.51 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者需诱使用户主动参与特定手势交互，攻击复杂度较低但需用户交互配合。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1922"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:20Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome for Android 至 134.0.6998.35 或更高版本，可通过 Google Play 商店检查并安装更新。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户应升级至 134.0.3124.51 或更高版本。临时缓解措施可配置浏览器禁用不受信任来源的 HTML 页面交互，并提醒用户勿在不可信页面上执行特定 UI 手势操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/384033062","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1