omium 的浏览器请参照厂商提供的对应修复版本进行更新。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中禁用未授权的外设访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/387583503","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1921.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-19xx/CVE-2025-1921.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1921.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0630.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0628","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1919","title":"Google Chrome Media 越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 134.0.6998.35 之前版本的 Media 组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发越界内存访问，导致敏感信息泄露或内存破坏。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 等浏览器，用户交互（点击链接）为攻击条件，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 134.0.6998.35 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1919"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 134.0.6998.35 或更高版本（通过 chrome://settings/help 检查更新并重启浏览器）。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户应升级至 134.0.3124.51 或更高版本。该漏洞位于 Media 组件中，攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTML 页面触发越界读取，建议在无法立即升级时启用站点隔离（Site Isolation）并禁用不信任来源的媒体内容自动播放作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/392375312","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1919.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1919.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1919.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-19xx/CVE-2025-1919.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0627","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0627.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1918","title":"Google Chrome PDFium 越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 PDFium 组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），版本早于 134.0.6998.35 时受影响。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的恶意 PDF 文件触发该漏洞，导致浏览器进程发生越界内存访问，结合堆布局与内容投毒可在目标系统上实现信息泄露或内存数据破坏，严重情况下可能造成拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。攻击需用户交互（点击/打开恶意 PDF），无需身份认证且攻击复杂度低，攻击向量为网络远程，CVSS 3.1 评分为 8.8，属于高危漏洞。受此影响的还包括基于 Chromium 内核的 Microsoft Edge（早于 134.0.3124.51）等衍生浏览器，Google 已于 Chrome 134.0.6998.35 版本修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1918"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:20Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级到 134.0.6998.35 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单「帮助→关于 Google Chrome」触发自动更新或从官网下载最新版。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户请升级到 134.0.3124.51 或更高版本（2025 年 3 月 7 日发布的稳定版），可在 Edge「设置→关于 Microsoft Edge」中更新。该漏洞因解析恶意构造的 PDF 文件触发越界读，日常应避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文档；在企业环境中，可借助组策略禁用 Edge 内置 PDF 阅读器（将 ShowPDFViewer 设为 0），并部署 Chrome 的强制更新策略，降低被远程利用导致的内存访问风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/388557904","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1918.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1918.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1918.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-19xx/CVE-2025-1918.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0627.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0626","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1917","title":"Google Chrome Android 浏览器 UI 实现不当导致界面欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome Android 版本在 134.0.6998.35 之前存在浏览器 UI 实现不当漏洞（CWE-1021），远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面在目标设备上执行 UI 欺骗攻击，诱导用户误认为正在与合法界面元素交互，从而执行非预期操作。该漏洞仅影响 Android 平台上的 Chrome 及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 浏览器，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互触发，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 134.0.6998.35 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1917"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:20Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome for Android 至 134.0.6998.35 或更高版本，可通过 Google Play 商店检查并安装更新。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户应升级至 134.0.3124.51 或更高版本。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 并避免点击不可信链接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/329476341","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1917.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1917.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1917.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1917.json","https